-K0H-2DOKQno1lJI3QcVaZpmx88MvxUrq6qhplU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSpOYmKjs526QRjXa-6KqA4Zyt-Uwi5WU_xxTxTeMpjpA&oe=6AFB3E80"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rogue Pi\u00f1atas: VRmageddon", "keywords": ["roguelite", "roguepinatas", "roguelike", "pinatas", "action"], "long_description": "A multiplayer VR roguelite game. Your mission? Survive the party-apocalyptic world, bashing your way through waves of invading Pi\u00f1atas!\n\n18+ Pi\u00f1ata Enemies:\nThese pi\u00f1atas are somehow thinking, moving, and growing smarter - each with their own enemy behaviors! \n\n6 Characters to Choose:\nAs one of the few survivors, it\u2019s up to you to answer the call!\n\n6 World-Ending Locations:\nFrom your local neighborhood to the treacherous desert, each area offers new dangers and opportunities for mayhem. \n\nWeapon Galore: Master over 150+ different combinations of attack through weapon evolutions and Dual Wielding.\n\nOnline Multiplayer: Team up with friends in an intense cooperative multiplayer mode, where you'll need to work together to survive the relentless onslaught of pi\u00f1atas.\n\nHidden Secrets:\nFind the hidden Ninjas and other secrets in in every level by looking high and low.", "short_description": "A multiplayer VR roguelite game. Your mission? Survive the party-apocalyptic world by bashing your way through swarms of invading Pi\u00f1atas, where every swing could mean survival or sweet defeat!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nerdninjas.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nerd Ninjas", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.nerdninjas.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "ge